{"name": "Fimbulstray", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fimbulstray is an atmospheric puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a lone girl wandering a world at its end. Drive across the snow-buried ruins of humankind. Drift over a homeland drowned by the sea. Uncover the truth of a dead world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Driving Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/0e8868e181da3a0847b5818844392170.poster.avif?t=1792399769\" width=\"400\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/0e8868e181da3a0847b5818844392170.webm?t=1792399769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/0e8868e181da3a0847b5818844392170.mp4?t=1792399769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the wheel of a one-of-a-kind little car built for the end of days, and make your way alone across a snow-covered wasteland. Take in landscapes shaped by the ruins of civilization and the natural world alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/98b777eb8bb10dac77fe5d13c36a98e8.poster.avif?t=1792399769\" width=\"400\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/98b777eb8bb10dac77fe5d13c36a98e8.webm?t=1792399769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/98b777eb8bb10dac77fe5d13c36a98e8.mp4?t=1792399769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humankind is extinct, yet the machines it left behind are still running. The wasteland looks peaceful, but something stirs beneath the surface. Venture into danger alone, and overcome its trials on a journey as lonely as it is thought-provoking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/f289352990255ead826249c193dc2d46.poster.avif?t=1792399769\" width=\"400\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/f289352990255ead826249c193dc2d46.webm?t=1792399769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/f289352990255ead826249c193dc2d46.mp4?t=1792399769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study and use the objects and mechanisms left behind by those who came before, and unravel puzzle after puzzle. Scavenge as many supplies as you can along the way \u2014 you never know what the journey will throw at you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/8ac15bfcd219e1623ee8b74d770d1315.poster.avif?t=1792399769\" width=\"400\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/8ac15bfcd219e1623ee8b74d770d1315.webm?t=1792399769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/extras/8ac15bfcd219e1623ee8b74d770d1315.mp4?t=1792399769\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the volatile weather and environment of a world after the end. Blizzards can roll in without warning. Come prepared.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Fimbulstray is an atmospheric puzzle adventure. Play as a lone girl wandering a world at its end. Drive across the snow-buried ruins of humankind. Drift over a homeland drowned by the sea. Uncover the truth of a dead world.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5296190/74b605d5a8fc8d67dd65e25c9a81ef3b0331cbe3/header.jpg?t=1792399769", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Atmospheric", "Puzzle Platformer", "2.5D", "Post-apocalyptic", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "GYRO Industry", "publishers": "GYRO Industry", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5296190", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "19 October 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0MmUpIfVoFo", "first_seen": 1792360800.0, "review_rank": 35}